abstract: "A results-only archive and new offline reader for a bounded, same-generation study of a learned action policy. Sixteen transfer outputs were exact across four situations and four methods. No task-general benefit or advantage over the equivalent classical option is established. The campaign runtime is not included."
keywords:
  - OASI
  - runtime assurance
  - reproducibility
  - bounded service
